   451	- **ADR-0106 (forthcoming): Temporal Primitives in the Entity Graph** — Defines the trajectory types (engagement curves, role progressions, health trajectory) that abilities consume.
   452	- **ADR-0107 (forthcoming): Evaluation Harness for Abilities** — Defines how abilities are scored, gated, and regressed. Co-dependency per Risk #5.
   453	- **ADR-0108 (forthcoming): Surface-Independent Ability Invocation** — Specifies MCP and Tauri binding rules concretely (which follows from §7.3).
