    28	### 1. Every invocation carries an invocation record
    29	
    30	Every ability invocation, every mutation service function, every background worker pass, and every LLM provider call emits a structured **invocation record**. Records are NDJSON lines to stderr under a single consistent schema.
    31	
    32	Minimum required fields:
    33	
