.docs/plans/wave-W2/reviews/DOS-259-l0-codex-consult-v3.md:43:- `.docs/plans/wave-W2/DOS-259-plan.md` §4, line 85: "Evaluate-mode replay routing is structurally enforced via the AbilityContext-bearing factory plus the ADR-0091 AppState `Arc`-swap pattern."
