.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:2338:.docs/plans/wave-W2/reviews/DOS-209-l0-architect-reviewer.md:69:This is correct — but it leaves Evaluate-mode determinism partial. Suite E's property test on `check_mutation_allowed` (named in §9) will be green even though Evaluate runs against schemas with `DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP` will produce non-reproducible timestamps. W3-G's `source_asof` work and W4-A's Trust Compiler freshness math both consume timestamps; if they read DB-defaulted values during an Evaluate run, snapshot-diff scoring will be flaky.
